cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "biocast: parametric shape generation and success estimation for bio-cemented construction waste"
message: "If you use this tool, please cite the Still Life project it was built for."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Generates cast geometries for Bacillus subtilis MICP on ground construction
  waste, checks them against a machine-readable rule set derived from project
  casting notes and retrieved literature, and estimates the probability of
  complete solidification with propagated uncertainty and an attributed
  failure mode.
keywords:
  - MICP
  - biocementation
  - Bacillus subtilis
  - construction waste
  - parametric design
  - reaction-diffusion
license: CC-BY-4.0
